# Soft background colour

When the user says **soft background** or **soft background colour**, use the home services-band grey:

```css
background: var(--fog); /* #f5f5f5 */
```

Reference: home `.services` section (yellow asterisk / “Strategic thinking…”).

Do not use `#fafafa`, pure white, or other greys unless explicitly asked.
